  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Chiman: The Great Bloom",
      "description": "Meet Chiman: a burlap grass head with a garden growing out of his hair, hopping between flowerpots that float in an evening sky. One touch is all it takes.\n\nREAL 3D, EVEN ON YOUR WRIST\nChiman is rendered in real-time 3D with soft, clay-like lighting. No flat sprites, no video. And it is the same 3D game everywhere: iPhone, iPad, Mac, Apple TV and Apple Watch.\n\nONE TOUCH\nHold to charge a jump. Release on the mark. Too short and he falls, too long and he sails past. Nothing to learn, plenty to master.\n\nCATCH THE DEW\nChiman dries out as he climbs. Grab the dew drops between the pots, or he withers.\n\nMIND THE SHEARS\nSome pots come with garden shears. Land while they snap and you lose water and your streak.\n\nNO LAST LEVEL\nThe pots keep coming and the gaps keep changing. There is only your best run, and the next one.\n\nPLAY ANYWHERE\nNo account, no sign-in, and no internet needed to play. Your best score stays on your device.\n\nA SECOND CHANCE\nWhen a run ends on iPhone or iPad you can choose to watch one short video to revive Chiman, once per run. It never plays unless you ask. No banners, no pop-ups.\n\nALSO ON YOUR WRIST\nThe iPhone app includes the Apple Watch version of the same 3D game. It runs on the watch on its own, with no phone nearby, and needs Apple Watch Series 9, Ultra 2 or later.\n\nAlso available for Mac and Apple TV.",
      "releaseNotes": "Apple Watch: performance and stability improvements.",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/chiman-the-great-bloom/id6807136278?uo=4",
